fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_region_proof_table_from_sources_result %impure fn &SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheActualWalkerTraversalSourceTable Result SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionProofTable SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionProofProducerErrorKind \sources:
