fn selfhost_memo_call_backend_private_cache_region_no_escape_candidate_i32_result %fn Result SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionNoEscapeCandidateRecord SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionProofProducerErrorKind Result i32 SelfhostMemoCallBackendPrivateCacheRegionProofProducerErrorKind \candidate_result:
